/*!
\page page_stEmcModule StEmcModule

\brief One readout module of a STAR EMC sub-detector, holding raw hits.

\section emcmodule_overview Overview

StEmcModule groups the raw hits (StEmcRawHit objects) that belong to a
single readout module of an EMC sub-detector.  For BEMC towers there are
120 modules (each covering 40 η-towers in a narrow φ slice); for SMD planes
a module holds a set of strip channels.

\section emcmodule_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StEmcModule
\endcode

Owned by \ref page_stEmcDetector "StEmcDetector"; accessed via
\c StEmcDetector::module(uint).

\section emcmodule_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| StSPtrVecEmcRawHit | mHits | Strongly-owned collection of raw hits in this module. |

\section emcmodule_methods Key Methods

- \c numberOfHits() — hit count.
- \c hits() — mutable/const access to the hit vector.
- \c getEnergy() — sum of calibrated hit energies [GeV].
- \c printNumberOfHits() — print module hit count (ROOT browser).

\section emcmodule_seealso See Also

\ref page_stEmcRawHit "StEmcRawHit",
\ref page_stEmcDetector "StEmcDetector"
*/
